  "bio": "Alain Heutschi is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Berne, Switzerland, renowned for his expertise in the 'black&gray' tattoo style. His work showcases an exceptional level of detail and shading which reflects his dedication to his craft. Clients appreciate Alain's professionalism, which is evident from the immaculate cleanliness he maintains in his work environment, ensuring a safe and welcoming experience for all who seek his services.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Berne, Berne, Switzerland\n\n※ 𝚃𝚊𝚝𝚝𝚘𝚘 • 𝚂𝚒𝚗𝚌𝚎 𝟸𝟶𝟷𝟽 •\n※ 𝙶𝚞𝚛𝚝𝚎𝚗𝚋𝚛𝚊𝚞𝚎𝚛𝚎𝚒 𝟷𝟸, 𝙱𝚎𝚛𝚗\n※ 𝙳𝙼 | 𝟶𝟽𝟾 𝟽𝟿𝟷𝟾𝟹𝟶𝟾",
